<title>USA: Network Long Distance names new president.</title>
<headline>Network Long Distance names new president.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Long Distance Inc said Monday that it has named Timothy Barton as president.</p>
<p>Barton was president of United Wats Inc of Kansas City, Missouri, which recently merged with Network Long Distance and became a company subsidiary.</p>
<p>Former company president Michael Ross will remain chief executive, said company spokesman Louis Resweber.</p>
</text>
